# This example is for mad 1 in Lazor (from the assignment handout)
#   x = no block allowed
#   o = blocks allowed
#   A = fixed reflect block
#   B = fixed opaque block
#   C = fixed refract block

GRID START
o o o o
o o o o
o o o o
o o o o
GRID STOP

# 2 reflect blocks and 1 refract block
A 2
C 1

# Laser: x, y, vx, vy
L 2 7 1 -1

# Points the lasers must pass through
P 3 0
P 4 3
P 2 5
P 4 7
